rota lap 4465, row 0 -- Aether, the row that hears; its threshold page ends on the line this lap spent itself proving: a guard that cannot red guards nothing, and a witness must be proven able to make a sound before its silence means anything
think The cold scoped pass read 192 run, 188 green, 3 red. One red was three hours old rather than inherited: standing_equipment_redleg, seated 20260909.152755, holds guards that assert only on a delegate under a ceiling of 53, and glow_rune_alphabet joined the roster at 20260909.155028 as the 54th.
think Diffed the roster against the commit that wrote the ceiling: three guards arrived, tame_core_surface and query_wire_retention each carrying a control, glow_rune_alphabet carrying none. Its own lap proved six refusals in a throwaway pen and discarded the pen, so the proof existed and no tracked file held it.
think Claimed it out of Pheromone's lane under claim-as-override: it reds every ship every lap, and that lane's recommend points at the other 83 unrostered glow witnesses rather than at this.
think Probed four plants in a worktree pen before writing anything. The worker reads the digraph count first, so any plant changing the population size reads as a count fault whatever else it did; each plant therefore keeps the count at thirty and moves one head, which is what keeps the four refusals distinct.
think Proved the control able to fail before trusting it: a mutated expectation reads pass=16 fail=1, exit 1.
obs The instrument the lap actually wanted was already in the tree. tools/c/convergence_tree_prove.sh, landed by this seat yesterday, is the pen discipline a $0-rooted subject needs, and the control borrows it whole -- copy the on-disk worker into the pen so a repair is proven in its current form.
obs Against my own elder card line: it claimed the convergence census reads proven_by_prover_run off the single-file prover alone. The grep covers convergence_(tree_)?prove.sh, and the one credit standing IS a tree-prover run. The gap is subjects rather than spelling -- exactly one tool in the tree has ever been asked.
obs Measured and not taken: readme_metrics_splice.sh reads verdict=converges on metal once the block file keeps the region's own markers. A block without them destroys both markers, the second run refuses no begin marker, and the prover reads write_once -- true, and about the sample. Recording the good run is one witness leg and moves the census 9 -> 10 of 12.
obs REDS stood 3 bytes under its bound, so no row could land until four rows folded. The card stood exactly AT its bound, so this account had to weigh what the elder weighed.
